{"id":"NFSC298","title":"Sports Nutrition Internship Practicum","department":"Nutrition and Food Science","level":"Undergrad","credits":"1","description":"Prerequisite: Must have completed or be concurrently enrolled in NFSC100; and permission of instructor; or students who have taken courses with comparable content may contact the department. Repeatable to 8 credits if content differs.\n\nThis internship allows students to gain hands on experience working in collegiate athletics. Students interact with an interdisciplinary team including registered dietitians, coaches, trainers, physicians and others to develop and enhance nutrition-related knowledge and skills. They also gain invaluable experience and exposure to the day-to-day duties of a collegiate sports dietitian. Students participate in a weekly 50-minute discussion that is held by two sports nutrition dietitians, and complete 9 hours per week hands on activities at Gossett Football Team House, Xfinity Center, and Varsity Team House.","gradingMethods":null,"noLongerOffered":false,"removedTerm":null,"removedDetected":null,"terms":[{"term":"201908","sections":1,"seats":20,"openSeats":12,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Colleen Carrion","Politimi Karamihas"],"removed":false},{"term":"202001","sections":1,"seats":20,"openSeats":13,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Colleen Carrion","Paula Karamihas"],"removed":false},{"term":"202108","sections":1,"seats":20,"openSeats":18,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Paula Karamihas","Colleen Carrion"],"removed":false},{"term":"202201","sections":1,"seats":20,"openSeats":13,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Colleen Carrion","Paula Karamihas"],"removed":false},{"term":"202208","sections":1,"seats":16,"openSeats":9,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Colleen Carrion","Paula Karamihas"],"removed":false},{"term":"202301","sections":1,"seats":20,"openSeats":17,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Colleen Carrion","Paula Karamihas"],"removed":false},{"term":"202308","sections":1,"seats":16,"openSeats":12,"waitlist"